{"speciesId":311,"names":{"fr":"Posipi","es":"Plusle","en":"Plusle","ja":"プラスル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"PLUSLE always acts as a cheerleader for its partners. Whenever a teammate puts out a good effort in battle, this POKéMON shorts out its body to create the crackling noises of sparks to show its joy."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"When PLUSLE is cheering on its partner, it flashes with electric sparks from all over its body. If its partner loses, this POKéMON cries loudly."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It has the trait of cheering on its fellow POKéMON. By shorting out the electricity it releases from its paws, it creates pom-poms for cheering."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It cheers on partners while scattering sparks from its body. It climbs telephone poles to absorb electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It cheers on partners while scattering sparks from its body. It climbs telephone poles to absorb electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It absorbs electricity from telephone poles. It shorts out its body to create crackling noises."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It absorbs electricity from telephone poles. It shorts out its body to create crackling noises."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il absorbe l’énergie des poteaux électriques et encourage ses amis avec des pompons d’étincelles."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il absorbe l’énergie des poteaux électriques et encourage ses amis avec des pompons d’étincelles."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il absorbe l’énergie des poteaux électriques et encourage ses amis avec des pompons d’étincelles."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Anima a sus compañeros con pompones de chispas. Roba energía de los postes telefónicos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"火花の ボンボンを 作って 仲間を 応援する。 電柱から 電気を 吸い取る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il absorbe l’énergie des poteaux électriques et court-circuite son corps pour produire du bruit."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Absorbe electricidad de los postes de teléfono. La almacena en su cuerpo y crea cortocircuitos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It absorbs electricity from telephone poles. It shorts out its body to create crackling noises."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"電柱から 電気を 吸い取る。 体に ためた 電気を ショートさせて 音を 出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Posipi sert de supporter à ses partenaires. Chaque fois qu’un membre de son équipe fait une belle action dans un combat, ce Pokémon court-circuite son corps et libère des étincelles pour montrer sa joie."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Plusle siempre anima a sus compañeros. Cuando algún miembro de su grupo hace un gran esfuerzo en combate, causa un cortocircuito en su interior para mostrar con el chisporroteo su alegría."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Plusle always acts as a cheerleader for its partners. Whenever a teammate puts out a good effort in battle, this Pokémon shorts out its body to create the crackling noises of sparks to show its joy."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"いつも 仲間を 応援している ポケモン。 仲間が 頑張ると 体を ショートさせて パチパチと 火花の 音を 立てて 喜ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quand Posipi veut encourager son partenaire, des étincelles jaillissent un peu partout de son corps. Si son partenaire perd, ce Pokémon pleure à chaudes larmes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando Plusle está animando a su compañero, resplandece y provoca un chisporroteo que le rodea todo el cuerpo. Si su compañero pierde, se pone a chillar a voz en grito."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When Plusle is cheering on its partner, it flashes with electric sparks from all over its body. If its partner loses, this Pokémon cries loudly."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"仲間を 応援する ときは 全身から 電気の 火花を 出して パチパチ 光る。 仲間が 負けると 大声で 泣いてしまう。"}],"varieties":[{"id":311,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"sing","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"